OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming more isolated for a time this
OL,7,Fevening before an organised band
OL,8,Fsweeps through in the early hours.
OL,9,FWinds easing away from coastal areas.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FPatchy cloud and sunny
OL,12,Fspells with occasional showers at
OL,13,Ffirst, these dying out through the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Feeling pleasant in any
OL,15,Fsunny spells with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
