OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fsettled end to the week with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and light winds. Mist or fog
OL,8,Fpatches are possible in prone
OL,9,Flocations each night, lingering
OL,10,Fthrough morning at times.
